{"id":"d8d7d3ba56a05b13","group":"92","path":"92/92-df-rosser-system.md","title":"Rosser Provability Predicate","display":"df-rosser-system — Rosser Provability Predicate","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-df-rosser-system","aliases":["92-df-rosser-system"],"display":"df-rosser-system — Rosser Provability Predicate","depends_on":["[[92-df-proof-predicate]]","[[92-df-godel-numbering]]","[[92-df-formula]]","[[92-df-encoding-completeness]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-df-rosser-system"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-df-rosser-system</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-rosser-system — Rosser Provability Predicate"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"7e21e34fc6bec397\" href=\"?note=7e21e34fc6bec397\" title=\"92-df-proof-predicate\">92-df-proof-predicate</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"2413c1d0ca8a0ce6\" href=\"?note=2413c1d0ca8a0ce6\" title=\"92-df-godel-numbering\">92-df-godel-numbering</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"5a1bd470754681a7\" href=\"?note=5a1bd470754681a7\" title=\"92-df-formula\">92-df-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"bb4321f7cd8a5eb1\" href=\"?note=bb4321f7cd8a5eb1\" title=\"92-df-encoding-completeness\">92-df-encoding-completeness</a></span></div>"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"df-rosser-system-—-External-Rosser-Provability-Predicate\">df-rosser-system — External Rosser Provability Predicate</h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Prf}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{Prf}_G\\)</span> (proof predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"7e21e34fc6bec397\" href=\"?note=7e21e34fc6bec397\" title=\"92-df-proof-predicate\">92-df-proof-predicate</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Code}_G(\\mathrm{Fml}_G)\">\\(\\mathrm{Code}_G(\\mathrm{Fml}_G)\\)</span> (formula-code set, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"5a1bd470754681a7\" href=\"?note=5a1bd470754681a7\" title=\"92-df-formula\">92-df-formula</a>, <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"2413c1d0ca8a0ce6\" href=\"?note=2413c1d0ca8a0ce6\" title=\"92-df-godel-numbering\">92-df-godel-numbering</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\ulcorner\\cdot\\urcorner\">\\(\\ulcorner\\cdot\\urcorner\\)</span> (Gödel numbering, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"2413c1d0ca8a0ce6\" href=\"?note=2413c1d0ca8a0ce6\" title=\"92-df-godel-numbering\">92-df-godel-numbering</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Dec}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{Dec}_G\\)</span> (decoder on legal codes, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"bb4321f7cd8a5eb1\" href=\"?note=bb4321f7cd8a5eb1\" title=\"92-df-encoding-completeness\">92-df-encoding-completeness</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(m\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span> (candidate conclusion code)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{NegCode}_G,\\mathrm{RProvCode}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{NegCode}_G,\\mathrm{RProvCode}_G\\)</span> (definition-target code-negation operator and external Rosser-provability predicate)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}rosser\\text{-}system} \\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{NegCode}_G&amp;:\\mathrm{Code}_G(\\mathrm{Fml}_G)\\to\\mathrm{Code}_G(\\mathrm{Fml}_G),\\\\\n\\mathrm{NegCode}_G(m)&amp;\\coloneqq\\ulcorner\\neg\\mathrm{Dec}_G(m)\\urcorner\n\\qquad(m\\in\\mathrm{Code}_G(\\mathrm{Fml}_G)),\\\\\n\\mathrm{RProvCode}_G(m)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\nm\\in\\mathrm{Code}_G(\\mathrm{Fml}_G)\\land\n\\exists k\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Prf}_G(k,m)\\land\n\\forall j&lt;k\\;\\neg\\mathrm{Prf}_G(j,\\mathrm{NegCode}_G(m))\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}rosser\\text{-}system} \\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{NegCode}_G&amp;:\\mathrm{Code}_G(\\mathrm{Fml}_G)\\to\\mathrm{Code}_G(\\mathrm{Fml}_G),\\\\\n\\mathrm{NegCode}_G(m)&amp;\\coloneqq\\ulcorner\\neg\\mathrm{Dec}_G(m)\\urcorner\n\\qquad(m\\in\\mathrm{Code}_G(\\mathrm{Fml}_G)),\\\\\n\\mathrm{RProvCode}_G(m)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\nm\\in\\mathrm{Code}_G(\\mathrm{Fml}_G)\\land\n\\exists k\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Prf}_G(k,m)\\land\n\\forall j&lt;k\\;\\neg\\mathrm{Prf}_G(j,\\mathrm{NegCode}_G(m))\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>本文件没有定义新的形式系统<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G^R\">\\(G^R\\)</span>；它定义的是外部数值谓词<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RProvCode}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{RProvCode}_G\\)</span></li>\n<li>该谓词表示“存在给定句的证明码，且没有更小的该句之否定的证明码”；Rosser句使用它的内部算术表示式之否定</li>\n<li>在固定有效证明编码下，该谓词是c.e.并可由<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_1\">\\(\\Sigma_1\\)</span>公式表示；这一内部表示式必须另行选定，不能把外部关系直接塞进对象语言</li>\n<li>Rosser定理在有效可公理化、足够强且相容的系统上用这种有界较短证明比较把<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span>一致性降为普通一致性</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"df-rosser-system-—-External-Rosser-Provability-Predicate","text":"df-rosser-system — External Rosser Provability Predicate","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-proof-predicate","status":"resolved","id":"7e21e34fc6bec397","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-proof-predicate]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-godel-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"2413c1d0ca8a0ce6","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-godel-numbering]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"5a1bd470754681a7","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-encoding-completeness","status":"resolved","id":"bb4321f7cd8a5eb1","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-encoding-completeness]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-proof-predicate","status":"resolved","id":"7e21e34fc6bec397","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Prf}_G$ (proof predicate, see [[92-df-proof-predicate]])","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"5a1bd470754681a7","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Code}_G(\\mathrm{Fml}_G)$ (formula-code set, see [[92-df-formula]], [[92-df-godel-numbering]])","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-godel-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"2413c1d0ca8a0ce6","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Code}_G(\\mathrm{Fml}_G)$ (formula-code set, see [[92-df-formula]], [[92-df-godel-numbering]])","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-godel-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"2413c1d0ca8a0ce6","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\ulcorner\\cdot\\urcorner$ (Gödel numbering, see [[92-df-godel-numbering]])","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-encoding-completeness","status":"resolved","id":"bb4321f7cd8a5eb1","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Dec}_G$ (decoder on legal codes, see [[92-df-encoding-completeness]])","embed":false}],"ma